---
/**
 * LandingBento.astro
 * Vertical Step-by-Step Feature Showcase using exact Smartphone Device Mockup frames.
 * 100% matched to user's uploaded reference image (rounded bezel, side buttons, top camera pill notch).
 */
---

<section class="relative bg-canvas dark:bg-[#0b0f19] py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden" id="fitur" aria-labelledby="pinoka-feature-heading">
  <!-- Subtle ambient background glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[1200px] h-[800px] bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(20,184,166,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)] pointer-events-none z-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1080px] mx-auto flex flex-col gap-16 sm:gap-24">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center opacity-0 animate-lp-fade-up">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-xs font-bold text-primary mb-3">
        <span>Alur Kerja & Fitur Utama</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3rem)] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight text-main mb-4" id="pinoka-feature-heading">
        Kemudahan Kelola Toko Online<br />
        <span class="text-primary">Dalam 4 Langkah Praktis</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[1.0625rem] text-muted max-w-[52ch] mx-auto leading-relaxed m-0">
        Dirancang khusus untuk mempermudah operasional toko UMKM dan memberikan penghasilan pasif bagi desainer lokal.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 1: Visual Editor -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center opacity-0 animate-lp-fade-up">
      <!-- Text Info (Left on Desktop) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <!-- Large Step Number & Category Badge -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-[clamp(2.5rem,4.5vw,3.75rem)] font-black text-primary leading-none tracking-tighter shrink-0 select-none">
            01
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary/20">
            Untuk Merchant
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-main tracking-tight m-0">
          Editor Visual Drag & Drop
        </h3>
        <p class="text-body-base text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">
          Kustomisasi nama toko, warna tema, logo, dan katalog produk secara langsung di kanvas visual — tanpa perlu mengerti koding atau pemetaan server.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pt-2 text-xs font-medium text-main">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Live visual editor langsung di smartphone</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Penyimpanan perubahan otomatis (*Auto-Save*)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Smartphone Device Mockup Frame (Right on Desktop) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center">
        <!-- Phone Frame Outer Container matching exact uploaded screenshot -->
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-[260px] sm:max-w-[280px] aspect-[9/18.5] rounded-[40px] border-[5px] border-[#1e293b] bg-[#0f172a] p-2.5 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/60">
          <!-- Physical Side Buttons -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[8px] top-16 w-1.5 h-8 bg-[#334155] rounded-l-md"></div>
          <div class="absolute -left-[8px] top-28 w-1.5 h-10 bg-[#334155] rounded-l-md"></div>
          <div class="absolute -right-[8px] top-20 w-1.5 h-12 bg-[#334155] rounded-r-md"></div>

          <!-- Full White Inner Screen Slot -->
          <div class="relative w-full h-full rounded-[30px] overflow-hidden bg-white text-slate-900 p-3.5 pt-2 flex flex-col justify-between font-sans shadow-inner">
            <!-- Top Camera Notch Pill -->
            <div class="w-16 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-950 mx-auto mb-2 flex items-center justify-end px-2 shrink-0">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-800"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Screen Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading">Builder Toko</span>
              <span class="bg-primary/10 text-primary px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold text-[9px]">Editor Visual</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Replaceable Screenshot Container Slot -->
            <div class="my-auto p-4 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 text-center space-y-1.5 shadow-2xs">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading">Warung Kopi Ijen</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-primary font-bold">Slot Foto Dashboard Editor</div>
              <p class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 m-0">Tempel screenshot dashboard toko Anda di sini</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
              Pinoka Mobile Editor
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2: WhatsApp Orders -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center opacity-0 animate-lp-fade-up">
      <!-- Smartphone Device Mockup Frame (Left on Desktop) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-[260px] sm:max-w-[280px] aspect-[9/18.5] rounded-[40px] border-[5px] border-[#1e293b] bg-[#0f172a] p-2.5 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-emerald-500/60">
          <!-- Physical Side Buttons -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[8px] top-16 w-1.5 h-8 bg-[#334155] rounded-l-md"></div>
          <div class="absolute -left-[8px] top-28 w-1.5 h-10 bg-[#334155] rounded-l-md"></div>
          <div class="absolute -right-[8px] top-20 w-1.5 h-12 bg-[#334155] rounded-r-md"></div>

          <!-- Full White Inner Screen Slot -->
          <div class="relative w-full h-full rounded-[30px] overflow-hidden bg-white text-slate-900 p-3.5 pt-2 flex flex-col justify-between font-sans shadow-inner">
            <!-- Top Camera Notch Pill -->
            <div class="w-16 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-950 mx-auto mb-2 flex items-center justify-end px-2 shrink-0">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-800"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Screen Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading">WhatsApp Order</span>
              <span class="bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold text-[9px]">Format Rapi</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Replaceable Screenshot Container Slot -->
            <div class="my-auto p-3.5 bg-emerald-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200/80 text-left space-y-2 text-[10px]">
              <div class="font-bold text-emerald-950">Halo Admin Toko! Saya pesan:</div>
              <div class="font-mono bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 space-y-1 text-slate-800 shadow-2xs">
                <div>• 2x Kopi Susu Aren (Rp 36k)</div>
                <div>• 1x Croissant (Rp 14k)</div>
                <div class="pt-1.5 text-emerald-700 font-bold border-t border-slate-100 mt-1">Total: Rp 50.000</div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[9px] text-emerald-600 text-center font-bold pt-1">Slot Foto Chat WhatsApp</div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
              Pinoka WA Checkout
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Info (Right on Desktop) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-4 order-1 lg:order-2">
        <!-- Large Step Number & Category Badge -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-[clamp(2.5rem,4.5vw,3.75rem)] font-black text-emerald-500 leading-none tracking-tighter shrink-0 select-none">
            02
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/20">
            Format Pesanan Otomatis
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-main tracking-tight m-0">
          Order Langsung Masuk ke WhatsApp
        </h3>
        <p class="text-body-base text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">
          Pembeli dapat memilih produk dan langsung mengirimkan format pesanan terstruktur ke nomor WhatsApp toko Anda tanpa perlu registrasi rumit.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pt-2 text-xs font-medium text-main">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Format pesan otomatis rapi & mudah diproses</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Tanpa biaya potongan komisi transaksi</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3: Designer Royalty -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center opacity-0 animate-lp-fade-up">
      <!-- Text Info (Left on Desktop) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <!-- Large Step Number & Category Badge -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-[clamp(2.5rem,4.5vw,3.75rem)] font-black text-purple-500 leading-none tracking-tighter shrink-0 select-none">
            03
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 bg-purple-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-purple-500/20">
            Untuk Desainer Template
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-main tracking-tight m-0">
          Penghasilan Pasif Setiap Bulan
        </h3>
        <p class="text-body-base text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">
          Unggah karya template terbaik Anda. Dapatkan royalti komisi otomatis setiap kali template dipilih dan digunakan oleh merchant UMKM.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pt-2 text-xs font-medium text-main">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Pencatatan royalti real-time di dashboard</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Penarikan dana langsung ke rekening bank lokal</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Smartphone Device Mockup Frame (Right on Desktop) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-[260px] sm:max-w-[280px] aspect-[9/18.5] rounded-[40px] border-[5px] border-[#1e293b] bg-[#0f172a] p-2.5 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-purple-500/60">
          <!-- Physical Side Buttons -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[8px] top-16 w-1.5 h-8 bg-[#334155] rounded-l-md"></div>
          <div class="absolute -left-[8px] top-28 w-1.5 h-10 bg-[#334155] rounded-l-md"></div>
          <div class="absolute -right-[8px] top-20 w-1.5 h-12 bg-[#334155] rounded-r-md"></div>

          <!-- Full White Inner Screen Slot -->
          <div class="relative w-full h-full rounded-[30px] overflow-hidden bg-white text-slate-900 p-3.5 pt-2 flex flex-col justify-between font-sans shadow-inner">
            <!-- Top Camera Notch Pill -->
            <div class="w-16 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-950 mx-auto mb-2 flex items-center justify-end px-2 shrink-0">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-800"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Screen Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading">Dompet Desainer</span>
              <span class="bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold text-[9px]">Royalti</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Replaceable Screenshot Container Slot -->
            <div class="my-auto p-3.5 bg-purple-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-purple-200/80 text-center space-y-1.5 shadow-2xs">
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Total Saldo Royalti</span>
              <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 font-heading">Rp 1.450.000</div>
              <div class="text-[9px] text-purple-700 font-bold">Slot Foto Saldo Desainer</div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
              Pinoka Designer Wallet
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4: Speed & Mobile Performance -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center opacity-0 animate-lp-fade-up">
      <!-- Smartphone Device Mockup Frame (Left on Desktop) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-[260px] sm:max-w-[280px] aspect-[9/18.5] rounded-[40px] border-[5px] border-[#1e293b] bg-[#0f172a] p-2.5 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-cyan-500/60">
          <!-- Physical Side Buttons -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[8px] top-16 w-1.5 h-8 bg-[#334155] rounded-l-md"></div>
          <div class="absolute -left-[8px] top-28 w-1.5 h-10 bg-[#334155] rounded-l-md"></div>
          <div class="absolute -right-[8px] top-20 w-1.5 h-12 bg-[#334155] rounded-r-md"></div>

          <!-- Full White Inner Screen Slot -->
          <div class="relative w-full h-full rounded-[30px] overflow-hidden bg-white text-slate-900 p-3.5 pt-2 flex flex-col justify-between font-sans shadow-inner">
            <!-- Top Camera Notch Pill -->
            <div class="w-16 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-950 mx-auto mb-2 flex items-center justify-end px-2 shrink-0">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-800"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Screen Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading">PageSpeed Score</span>
              <span class="bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold font-mono text-[9px]">98/100</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Replaceable Screenshot Container Slot -->
            <div class="my-auto p-3.5 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 text-center space-y-1.5 shadow-2xs">
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Waktu Muat Toko</span>
              <div class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-600 font-mono">0.3 Detik</div>
              <div class="text-[9px] text-slate-600 font-bold">Slot Foto Skor Performa HP</div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
              Pinoka Mobile Performance
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Info (Right on Desktop) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-4 order-1 lg:order-2">
        <!-- Large Step Number & Category Badge -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-[clamp(2.5rem,4.5vw,3.75rem)] font-black text-cyan-500 leading-none tracking-tighter shrink-0 select-none">
            04
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/20">
            Optimasi Otomatis
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-main tracking-tight m-0">
          Super Cepat di Semua HP & Laptop
        </h3>
        <p class="text-body-base text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">
          Toko online Anda teroptimasi secara otomatis agar terbuka dalam hitungan milidetik saat diklik oleh calon pelanggan.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pt-2 text-xs font-medium text-main">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Tanpa perlu install aplikasi pihak ketiga</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>100% responsif di semua ukuran layar</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
